The internal dimensions of a drink container, in the shape of a rectangular prism, are shown.

\exfigure{36_q23_1}

To completely fill the container with the tropical drink, how many litres of mango juice are required?

solutions.latex:
\exfigure{36_q27_s1}

Using the trapezoidal rule on each of the two strips, with the scale giving a width of $20$ m for each:
$$\begin{aligned} A &\approx \dfrac{20}{2}(25+20)+\dfrac{20}{2}(20+20) \\ &= 850\ \text{m}^2 \end{aligned}$$

6201.stem:
Determine the area of the proposed Nirimba Fields development using the Six Maps website.

Instructions:

i. Go to the website: maps.six.nsw.gov.au/

ii. Close any opening messages on the website.

iii. Find the search bar at the top left corner and search Nirimba Fields.

\exfigure{3307_q1_1}

iv. Ensure you have found the area seen in the picture below and are observing the correct image of the region. You may need to zoom in or out to achieve this.

\exfigure{3307_q1_2}

v. Select the area tool to take your measurement.

\exfigure{3307_q1_3}

vi. Select the outer edge of the triangle as shown below (Note: this will require some estimation of where the edge is but try and be as accurate as you can. On the last point of the triangle, you will need to double click).

\exfigure{3307_q1_4}

